  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sleeping Arrangements <br>Two Story Home <br>First Floor | Master Bedroom, King Bed <br>Second Floor | Master Bedroom 2, King Bed; Guest Bedroom 2, King Bed; Guest Bedroom 3, Queen Bed; Guest Bedroom 4, Two Sets of Twin over Twin Bunks with pullout twin trundles<br><br>Parking: This property provides two driveway parking spots, offering guests direct access to the unit.<br><br>This beautiful golf course front beach home, nestled away on the Bay side of the SANDESTIN GOLF AND BEACH RESORT®, this home comes with a 6 seat Golf Cart in the coveted community of Villa Lago. Each home offers its own take blending a Tuscan feel with our Panhandle Florida charm. The comfortable beach vibe is noticed right away as you enter the home with a blend of light colors and cozy furnishings thoughtfully curated to make your next coastal vacation a trip to remember. This home is located across the street from the community pool for quick and easy access to the fun.<br> <br>The kitchen will “wow” any cook in your group! With granite countertops and stainless appliances, there is plenty of counter space, perfect for whipping up a simple snack to enjoy on the patio overlooking the golf course or pack up something for everyone and create a sunset picnic – beach Resort style! The open concept first floor hosts the living area and dining area next to the kitchen. With doors leading out to the back patio where you can relax and grill out your next feast. There is even a half bath and washer/dryer on the first floor for convenience.<br> <br>Aside from the main master bedroom and full en suite bathroom on the 1st floor, the second floor hosts 4 of the home’s five bedrooms. There are two additional master suites which each offer their own en suite, private bathrooms. The fourth bedroom has a queen bed and the fifth bedroom is perfect for the kids with two sets of twin bunk beds, both with pullout twin trundles and an en suite bathroom with a tub/shower combo.<br> <br>Hop on the home’s golf cart or ready your bike and start your exploration of the beautiful resort where, from your doorstep, you’re just a few minutes away from resort life at its best! <br><br>Guest Walk-Through <br>Two Story Home – Kitchen, Living, Dining, 5 Bedrooms, 4.5 Bathrooms<br><br>Unit Amenities- Golf Cart, Laundry, Propane BBQ Grill, Private Driveway Parking for 2 Cars<br>Community Amenities- Community Pool<br>Resort Amenities- Gated Community, Multiple Pools, Resort Tram, Fitness Center/Spa/Salon, Golf, Tennis, Marina, Shops, Restaurants, Entertainment, Private Beach, Watersports<br><br>About the Community of Villa Lago<br>Villa Lago is the latest addition to the Resort offering single-family 3-, 4- and 5-bedroom homes with Mediterranean-style and resort comforts. Enjoy amenities such as the community pool and the first-class dining and entertainment options of the Village of Baytowne Wharf. Most properties have either a lake or golf course view. Rent with us today and discover what a truly relaxing and carefree vacation feels like at Villa Lago.<br><br>Local Favorites<br>MVH guests receive savings with our Local Favorites. Enjoy discounts to restaurants, beach activities, and shopping so you can save while you stay.<br><br>MVH Beach Closet <br>This property offers a Beach Closet stocked with complimentary beach chairs and an umbrella for use during your stay.<br><br>MVH Rental Restrictions<br>Please reference the Rental Restrictions and Terms of Use.<br> <br>SANDESTIN® is a federally registered trademark owned by Sandestin Investments, LLC (“SI”). My Vacation Haven, LLC is an independent entity and is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or associated with SI. Any use or reference to SI or its trademarks is solely to identify a property and not to suggest any affiliation with SI.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Golf Course View Beach Home with Golf Cart"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
