            "id": "0db36c02-372c-4981-8279-d7176a1915f0",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you, Nikhol, for taking the time to provide your review of your stay at Villa Lago 1848. Villa Lago truly boasts a perfect location within the resort. Golf carts undoubtedly enhance the fun factor of any vacation! We appreciate your comments regarding the upstairs back balcony. We've shared your feedback with our property manager and value your input. We eagerly anticipate your return and appreciate your 5 star review!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was very satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nLovely home right across the street from the pool. Perfect location with the golf cart made our trip convenient and fun. Loved the outside areas although the upstairs back balcony could use a little sprucing.",
        "title": "Family Vacation"
      },
      {
        "author": "Leigh B.",
        "date": "2025-08-05T14:03:00Z",
