          {
            "date": "Aug 17, 2025",
            "id": "5b2e7327-bb97-4540-92c3-e8204eb1ae02",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Leigh, we are delighted that you chose to return to Sandestin for a perfect vacation at Villa Lago 1848. We are pleased to hear that everyone in your party enjoyed the golf cart and the hidden gems on the resort. Thank you for your five-star review, and we appreciate your visit. We look forward to welcoming you back very soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was very satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nWe loved the home and the neighborhood. It’d been a while since I had been a dusting, but it definitely won’t be the last time! The house and golf cart made everything super convenient.",
        "title": "Great house and location"
      },
