        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was very satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nThe home is conveniently located across from a swimming pool, gravel parking lot and Baytowne Wharf. The are great views of the golf course from the covered patio. The home was clean, in great condition and had the right space & floor plan for our crew. The golf cart that comes with the home was new and we had no issues getting around. Thanks for letting us stay and we hope to be back soon.",
